<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Creative aeroplanes &amp;amp; flying objects by Japanese legendary director Hayao Miyazaki&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you know why Miyazaki loves airplanes so much? Miyazaki&amp;#x27;s father, Katsuji Miyazaki, who was an aeronautical engineer. During World War II, Katsuji Miyazaki worked as an engineer and director at his brother&amp;#x27;s firm, Miyazaki Airplane, which manufactured rudders for Japanese fighter planes. Being surrounded by aircraft parts and aviation sketches as a child inspired Hayao Miyazaki to draw planes from a young age.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is why you&amp;#x27;ll find ample amount of airplanes &amp;amp; beautiful designs of them in Ghibli movies of Miyazaki.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://yt3.ggpht.com/y0-8yEGwdOqfgzao5K0Hi7UmbePHaKMtubMl3a6Ar8VR_zZ3WL_xlU-yFLuMs60f2SnXrvkSEylrAA=s779-c-fcrop64=1,035c0000fca3ffff-rw-nd-v1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://yt3.ggpht.com/bERnqZqyR6cDiulDdbjKg4rS3u1mL6DTR0hD6M5v49d9v-WGUAGTq6m43Ly3gLoc0IIvBKTto8-45A=s584-c-fcrop64=1,228f0000dd70ffff-rw-nd-v1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://yt3.ggpht.com/QfUwvCz5hq3VTXlNs9cLZ3O1jK_q3tLh5zVO8DsLOd7Tfcp1NDlQyK3W93n6EOvQ96781wOWIZHiOg=s590-c-fcrop64=1,21990000de66ffff-rw-nd-v1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://yt3.ggpht.com/4vAeHUvCQQBtuCp2KgEKQmWo-BB-hWbrBgFJK3VfQO3NXRFdAQ6nZ3tj4kaWRbE_xkcY_uCDq7X_JQ=s942-c-fcrop64=1,00002309ffffdcf6-rw-nd-v1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://yt3.ggpht.com/S1ThYZ81HFQR6KP0Bj3S7Pz5TsmrPxgvOM-eBUOOFC3sPzRaHkbfT5TN3lBwE7qNp9IavsFXV8BvIA=s552-c-fcrop64=1,27ae0000d851ffff-rw-nd-v1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://yt3.ggpht.com/wKVb8-rlZelYwdUkbdRlVnolpGJgPwFRqAbHHFWZ4lUtcGg_LomduxiyN06s4fDqlsnhqxoZJAP_YQ=s541-c-fcrop64=1,29700000d68fffff-rw-nd-v1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://yt3.ggpht.com/MUBBp5TTML2cxuPm_hAS1hqu3cztra41IFbaPancd_5VAJj5Ui9VqcpexLNZ05mWt3OuQOhZ7UR8=s800-c